Gate standalone output behind STANDALONE_BUILD for Vercel/next start

Payload's template hard-codes output: 'standalone', which is for Docker
self-hosting. On Vercel the build then fails tracing
.next/next-server.js.nft.json, and next start (the Railway start
command) also needs the default output. Standalone is now opt-in via
STANDALONE_BUILD=1, which the Dockerfile sets during its build stage.

